# Trial-Size Trial by Wind (outlands 197): the battlefield's scroll arm with the Scroll of Instant Warp already held. A
# SMN of level 20 with this quest accepted, the Mini Tuning Fork of Wind and a Scroll of Instant Warp: the fork's
# trade to WP_Entrance, option 33 (index 2, arena 1), OGMIOS+3 killed; 32001's finish: Garuda learned
# (GARUDA_UNLOCKED 0, 0, 3), the scroll held: none given, San d'Oria and Bastok fame +10, completed.
char zone=CloisterOfGales pos=-357.6,-0.1,-380.0 job=SMN lvl=20
quest Outlands.TrialSizeTrialByWind accepted
item MiniTuningForkOfWind
item ScrollOfInstantWarp
login
trade WP_Entrance MiniTuningForkOfWind x1 # the fork: the entry menu 32000
update 32000 option=33                    # registered, entered, the fork taken
finish                                    # in the arena
kill OGMIOS+3                             # won, 32001 opens
finish                                    # Garuda learned; the scroll held: none given; San d'Oria and Bastok fame +10; completed
